flowchart TD
    A[Webhook POST] --> B[Start Apify Actor]
    B --> C[Wait Before Check]
    C --> D[Check Run Status]
    D --> E{Status?}
    E -- SUCCEEDED --> F[Get Scraped Dataset]
    F --> G[Map Job Fields]
    G --> H[Append to Google Sheets]
    E -- FAILED / ABORTED / TIMED-OUT --> I[Format Error]
    E -- Running / Other --> C
